                <p>
                    <occupation>Husbestyrerinde</occupation>. En <age type="approximate">ung</age>
                    <trait type="character">livlig</trait>
                    <person sex="female" role="employee">Enke, af god Familie</person>, önskar at <state type="reason">styre Huset</state> i <placeName type="employment">et dannet Hjem, hvor Husmoderen savnes</placeName>. Billet mrk <label>55</label> tillsendes <address type="application">Ladegaars Burean</address>, <street type="application">Pilesträde 9</street>, <placeName type="application" ref="#köpenhamn">Köbenhavn</placeName>.</p>
